  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyse og kvalitetssikring ifm Systems Wide Evaluation (SWE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to the quality assurance of the evaluations of UN&apos;s actions on Covid-19

Advisory and quality assurance in relation to the evaluation process. Amongst other advise to the evaluation consultants; to UN&apos;s coordinator for lateral evaluations (Systems Wide Evaluation - SWE) including quality assurance of documents including case-studies; assessment of different comments, received from different UN-organisations and UN-members in relation to the evaluation process).

Participation in meetings with the coordinator for evaluation, consultants, including different stakeholders inside and outside the UN system.</narrative>
  </description>
